<p>Your golem's skin shimmers with eldritch energies.</p><p>Any damage it takes is partly reflected (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">44%, 48%, 52%, 54%, 56%</acronym>) to the attacker.</p><p>The golem still takes full damage.</p><p>Damage returned will increase with your golem's Spellpower.</p>